@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
#@baseUrl = https://<your-app>.azurewebsites.net


### All VMs visible to the connected user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage


### Multi-value filters: OR within one field, AND across fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage?subscriptionId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&subscriptionId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111&location=westeurope&deploymentType=Regional&deploymentType=Zone%202&vmSize=Standard_D2s_v5&vmssFlexible=No


### Friendly subscription names are display-only; send the subscription ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage?subscriptionId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### An empty filter is unrestricted (same behavior as omitting it)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage?resourceGroup=


### Invalid finite filter value returns HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage?deploymentType=Zonal%201


### Reservation lifecycle status filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage?reservationStatus=Allocated%2C%20within%20capacity


### Mark one VM as requiring ODCR coverage
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"resourceIds": [
		"/subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resourceGroups/example-rg/providers/Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/example-vm"
	],
	"decision": "required",
	"priority": "high",
	"note": "Business-critical workload"
}


### Mark one VM as not requiring ODCR coverage
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"resourceIds": [
		"/subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resourceGroups/example-rg/providers/Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/example-vm"
	],
	"decision": "not_required",
	"priority": null,
	"note": "Covered by another continuity strategy"
}


### Clear a decision while retaining the latest-editor audit record
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"resourceIds": [
		"/subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resourceGroups/example-rg/providers/Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/example-vm"
	],
	"decision": null,
	"priority": null,
	"note": null
}


### Apply the same decision to several VMs (maximum 500 resource IDs)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/odcr/coverage/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"resourceIds": [
		"/subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resourceGroups/example-rg/providers/Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/example-vm-1",
		"/subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resourceGroups/example-rg/providers/Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/example-vm-2"
	],
	"decision": "required",
	"priority": "medium",
	"note": null
}